{
  "fps": 24,
  "totalFrames": 4657,
  "duration": 194.04,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "opening",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "2026年10月24日，香港启德。一个从1993年吹来的声音，突然闯进了The Weeknd的新歌《Hong Kong》。",
      "overlay": "2026  启德 · 1993 的回声",
      "gapSeconds": 1,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/01.mp3",
      "seconds": 10.68,
      "startFrame": 36,
      "voiceFrames": 261,
      "gapFrames": 24,
      "durationFrames": 285
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "opening",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "你以为他只是在致敬王菲。可把两首歌的词放在一起，才发现，最动人的不是旋律，而是两个年代，仿佛在接续同一次告别。",
      "overlay": "跨越三十三年的对话",
      "gapSeconds": 0.9,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/02.mp3",
      "seconds": 12.384,
      "startFrame": 321,
      "voiceFrames": 302,
      "gapFrames": 22,
      "durationFrames": 324
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "air",
      "role": "english",
      "text": "There was something in the air.",
      "overlay": "空气里，有种说不清的气息",
      "gapSeconds": 0.7,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/03.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.024,
      "startFrame": 645,
      "voiceFrames": 78,
      "gapFrames": 17,
      "durationFrames": 95
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "air",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "他记得初见时空气里的异样。那个人出现的一瞬间，整个世界都变得值得燃烧。",
      "overlay": "第一次相遇 · 无法解释的吸引",
      "gapSeconds": 0.4,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/04.mp3",
      "seconds": 8.28,
      "startFrame": 740,
      "voiceFrames": 204,
      "gapFrames": 10,
      "durationFrames": 214
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "stay",
      "role": "english",
      "text": "But my life won't let me stay.",
      "overlay": "但我的人生，不允许我留下",
      "gapSeconds": 0.5,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/05.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.168,
      "startFrame": 954,
      "voiceFrames": 81,
      "gapFrames": 12,
      "durationFrames": 93
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "stay",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "听清楚：不是不想留下。是再热烈的爱，也不一定能战胜现实。一个人愿意交出全部，却交不出最普通的陪伴。",
      "overlay": "想留下，却不能留下",
      "gapSeconds": 1.1,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/06.mp3",
      "seconds": 11.592,
      "startFrame": 1047,
      "voiceFrames": 283,
      "gapFrames": 26,
      "durationFrames": 309
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "separate",
      "role": "cantonese",
      "text": "明明還說分開。",
      "overlay": "明明说好要分开",
      "gapSeconds": 0.5,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/07.mp3",
      "seconds": 2.88,
      "startFrame": 1356,
      "voiceFrames": 74,
      "gapFrames": 12,
      "durationFrames": 86
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "separate",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "王菲却站在爱情的另一边。她明明已经决定离开，拥抱时，又一次失去勇气。一个人被生活困住，一个人被自己的心困住。",
      "overlay": "想离开，却舍不得离开",
      "gapSeconds": 0.95,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/08.mp3",
      "seconds": 12.384,
      "startFrame": 1442,
      "voiceFrames": 302,
      "gapFrames": 23,
      "durationFrames": 325
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "night",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "英文主歌还有更狠的一笔。昨夜他们贴得那么近，到了天亮，却像素未谋面的陌生人。感情才刚刚发生，就没有了明天。",
      "overlay": "昨夜相拥 · 清晨陌路",
      "gapSeconds": 1.15,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/09.mp3",
      "seconds": 12.36,
      "startFrame": 1767,
      "voiceFrames": 302,
      "gapFrames": 28,
      "durationFrames": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "wind",
      "role": "cantonese",
      "text": "那次季候風。你似季候風。",
      "overlay": "那阵风 · 你就像季候风",
      "gapSeconds": 0.6,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/10.mp3",
      "seconds": 5.184,
      "startFrame": 2097,
      "voiceFrames": 129,
      "gapFrames": 14,
      "durationFrames": 143
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "wind",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "王菲没有追问对方为什么走。她把那个人写成了风。来时改变了整个世界，走的时候，却不肯带走留下的痛。",
      "overlay": "风来时，一切都改变",
      "gapSeconds": 0.85,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/11.mp3",
      "seconds": 11.352,
      "startFrame": 2240,
      "voiceFrames": 277,
      "gapFrames": 20,
      "durationFrames": 297
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "empty",
      "role": "cantonese",
      "text": "不死的心痛。",
      "overlay": "风停以后，心痛仍在",
      "gapSeconds": 0.9,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/12.mp3",
      "seconds": 2.592,
      "startFrame": 2537,
      "voiceFrames": 67,
      "gapFrames": 22,
      "durationFrames": 89
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "empty",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "于是两首歌有了令人心碎的时间差。他唱的是离别发生的清晨。她唱的是离别以后，一遍遍醒来的夜晚。",
      "overlay": "清晨的离别 · 漫长的余痛",
      "gapSeconds": 1.25,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/13.mp3",
      "seconds": 11.112,
      "startFrame": 2626,
      "voiceFrames": 272,
      "gapFrames": 30,
      "durationFrames": 302
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "weather",
      "role": "english",
      "text": "Weathering changes.",
      "overlay": "经历风雨，承受变化",
      "gapSeconds": 0.7,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/14.mp3",
      "seconds": 2.544,
      "startFrame": 2928,
      "voiceFrames": 66,
      "gapFrames": 17,
      "durationFrames": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "weather",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "英文里，他试着习惯人生的变迁。粤语里，她明知季候会更替，却还是挡不住下一次心动。他们都懂得时间会改变一切，却都没学会怎样不再想念。",
      "overlay": "同一个天气隐喻",
      "gapSeconds": 1.15,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/15.mp3",
      "seconds": 14.952,
      "startFrame": 3011,
      "voiceFrames": 364,
      "gapFrames": 28,
      "durationFrames": 392
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "waiting",
      "role": "english",
      "text": "I'm waiting in Hong Kong.",
      "overlay": "我会在香港等你",
      "gapSeconds": 1,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/16.mp3",
      "seconds": 2.832,
      "startFrame": 3403,
      "voiceFrames": 73,
      "gapFrames": 24,
      "durationFrames": 97
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "waiting",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "整首歌最温柔的反转，就在这里。他先说无法留下，最后却说，依然等待。他没有保证重逢，只为一个可能永远不会回来的人，留下一个地址。",
      "overlay": "香港 · 等待的地址",
      "gapSeconds": 1.2,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/17.mp3",
      "seconds": 11.616,
      "startFrame": 3500,
      "voiceFrames": 284,
      "gapFrames": 29,
      "durationFrames": 313
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "city",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "而这个地址，偏偏叫香港。于是1993年的王菲，和2026年的The Weeknd，把一段爱情，唱成了我们对一座城市、一个年代的牵挂。",
      "overlay": "1993 ⇄ 2026",
      "gapSeconds": 0.9,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/18.mp3",
      "seconds": 13.296,
      "startFrame": 3813,
      "voiceFrames": 324,
      "gapFrames": 22,
      "durationFrames": 346
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "ending",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "她像是在说：风走了，我的痛还在。他像是在回答：如果风回来，我还在这里。三十三年，两个声音，一座城。原来有些歌不是重新响起，而是多年以后，终于有人替它说完了心事。",
      "overlay": "风走了 · 还有人在等",
      "gapSeconds": 2.2,
      "audio": "hongkong-wind-lyrics-20261031/voice/19.mp3",
      "seconds": 18.336,
      "startFrame": 4159,
      "voiceFrames": 445,
      "gapFrames": 53,
      "durationFrames": 498
    }
  ]
}